    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56333" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέᾰρ</span></b> , 
			contr.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῆρ</span> (q.v.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέαρνον</span></b> , τό, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεάζω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>carpenter's axe</i>, <i><span class="en">
