			</span></i>(pl.). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέαρος:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρτυξ</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεάσματα</span></b> , τά,
